
Security Analyst Role

As a Junior Security Analyst, also called a SOC Level 1 Analyst, you work in a 24/7 SOC team and mostly review the security alerts together with your colleagues.

3 Way Handshake
Syn - Ack - Syn/Ack - Establish
CENA - Control C, Enable for SecureCRT
Forward lookup - domain name to IP
reverse lookup - IP to domain name
PUKI - Public Key Infrastructure
Load balancing - distributing network traffic to all servers to ensure high availability
VAPT - Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing
For Active directory, Local > Global > User
